 "remarks": "Discover a Hidden Gem in North Stamford - South Brook Drive!! Amazing opportunity to build your DREAM HOME! A Nature Lover's Dream! This 2.09 acre parcel is located in a prestigious enclave of fine residences in North Stamford, on a quiet cul-de-sac. Nestled on 2 lush acres offering a bucolic natural setting with picturesque seasonal views of reservoir and plenty of privacy. Conveniently located near fine dining, shopping, theaters, parks, golf, hiking, beaches, and everything the vibrant City of Stamford is known for with easy access to train, airport and Hwys! Enjoy nearby Greenwich and the quaint towns of Pound Ridge/Bedford, NY. Build your perfect year-round home or an fantastic weekend retreat! Less than 1 hour to NYC! Purchaser to do all duediligence. Ask about other great lots available. This lot is also available with a \"To Be Built\" home with one of our Builder Partners offering various floor plans, built to suit you needs. Currently featuring a gorgeous Passive Home listed on MLS #24084396. Note: Taxes reflect current Forest designation. Seller has Real Estate license.",
